{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42547","headline":"癸卯闽乱从弟监察御史敬凝迎仕别作 · 詹琲","name":"癸卯闽乱从弟监察御史敬凝迎仕别作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一别几经春，栖迟晋水滨。\n鶺鴒长在念，鸿雁忽来宾。\n五斗嫌腰折，朋山刺眼新。\n善辞如复我，四海五湖身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹琲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}